Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.18,0:21:48.83,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}那條窗簾的另一邊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.00,0:21:53.84,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}是我不曾見過的天
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.16,0:22:01.27,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}你的聲音若隱若現
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.27,0:22:07.48,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}我生怕錯過任何瞬間
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.17,0:22:12.67,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}你習以為常的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.07,0:22:18.29,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}對我而言是如此特別
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.03,0:22:25.19,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}你低頭迷茫的時刻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.19,0:22:30.38,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}我多麼想陪在你身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.38,0:22:36.51,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}願這一瓣心聲隨花兒盛開
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.51,0:22:42.82,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}其中滿載著我對你的愛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.82,0:22:48.89,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}我要用最真誠坦率的姿態
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.06,0:22:58.90,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}與你並肩走向美好的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.51,0:23:07.60,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}請仔細聽我的告白
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.39,0:23:24.54,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}願這一瓣心聲隨花兒盛開
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.54,0:23:30.84,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}其中滿載著我對你的愛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.84,0:23:37.22,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0\t(2800,3800,\c&HFFFFFF&\bord2\blur3)}我要用最真誠坦率的姿態
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.22,0:23:42.45,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur3}與你攜起手來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.45,0:23:47.17,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur3}走向美好的明天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.46,0:23:53.14,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur3s}走向美好的明天
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.18,0:21:48.83,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}カーテン越しでは
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.00,0:21:53.84,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}見えない世界は
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.16,0:22:01.27,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}時々飲み込む声
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.27,0:22:07.48,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}聞き逃してしまいそう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.17,0:22:12.67,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}あなたが持つ普通は
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.07,0:22:18.29,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}それは特別なもので
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.03,0:22:25.19,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}見失い　俯く時
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.19,0:22:30.38,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}そばにいれたらいいのに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.38,0:22:36.51,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}咲かせよ　ひとひら　言葉を今
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.51,0:22:42.82,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}溢れ出す全部伝えたい想い
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.82,0:22:48.89,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}正直に　素直なまま
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.06,0:22:58.90,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}誇れる自分で隣を歩きたい
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.51,0:23:07.60,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}この声よ　届け
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.39,0:23:24.54,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}咲かせよ　ひとひら　言葉を今
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.54,0:23:30.84,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0}溢れ出す全部届けたい想い
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.84,0:23:37.22,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H090403&\bord0\t(2800,3800,\c&HFFFFFF&\bord2\blur3)}正直に　素直なまま
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.22,0:23:42.45,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur3}明日も隣同士
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.45,0:23:47.17,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur3}歩きたい
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.46,0:23:53.14,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur3s}歩きたい
