Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.25,0:01:05.34,Sign,,0,0,0,,{=63}{\pos(1368.686,1016.406)\org(1374.14,999.25)\fscx89.715\fscy117.647\frz36.243\fry2.471\frx3.947\fax0.302\fs24\fsp1\c&HD0D1D2&\blur0.5}現在可以打電話嗎？
